# Committed on purpose. These two values are public by design — the anon key is
# shipped inside the browser bundle on every page load, and Row Level Security
# in Postgres is what actually protects your data. Committing them means Vercel
# can build without any dashboard setup.
#
# The Gemini key is NOT here and must never be. It is a real secret and lives
# only in Vercel: Project → Settings → Environment Variables → LLM_API_KEY.
